# Scripts are run by bash and by bionic's shell on the phone; a CRLF in one of
# them is a `#!/usr/bin/env bash\r` that no kernel will execute. Git's Windows
# default would add exactly that, so the endings are pinned here instead.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
.github/**      text eol=lf

# Everything else: normal text, diffable, and normalised to LF in the repository.
*               text=auto
